{"5091370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sticks & Strings", "steam_appid": 5091370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sticks &amp; Strings is a first-person archery PvP shooter for up to 8 players. Pick a target, draw your bow, and aim carefully. No hitscan and no full-auto. Make every shot count.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5091370/extras/79b02d5ce654efc0395fdd4e675859dd.avif?t=1788200471\" width=630 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fifteen Game </strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">Breaking</span><strong> Changing Powerups</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go invisible with Phantom — just watch out for True Sight</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap up high with Cloud Hopper and rain arrows down on your foes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire three arrows at once with Multi-Nock, or go full artillery with Black Powder's explosive tips</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport across the map with Soul Shot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for special bows and arrows</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5091370/extras/aa86b32f0b85ed7110c2d41474750154.avif?t=1788200471\" width=630 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online PvP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to seven other friends. Host a private match or join a public lobby with &quot;Quick Join.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Friends?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add some bots to your lobby. They can run, jump, fight, and use powerups just like a real player. But be careful, some of them have gotten quite good at shooting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Customizable Game Settings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer skill over luck? Hosts can change powerup spawns to &quot;Never&quot; and run it as a pure, no-frills draw-and-shoot duel — no crutches, no gimmicks, just whoever's actually better with a bow. Or grab seven other friends and crank powerups to the max and see who can survive the longest. Enable teams to play a 4v4, a 2v2v2, or maybe a 1v5. It's up to you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Maps, Two Gamemodes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight it out across the Ruins, the Forest, and the Graveyard in Elimination or Deathmatch, with host-configurable win conditions — first to a kill count, last one standing after time runs out, or best of however many rounds you decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5091370/extras/159d59efa99c8bb3d666f8a33b3253ff.avif?t=1788200471\" width=1260 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>35 Achievements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do something cool in game and get a nice achievement on your profile. Try to collect them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play It Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full key rebinding for every action. Plenty of in-game options. Change your name and your character's color. Public or private lobbies with quick join. No accounts beyond Steam.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sticks &amp; Strings is a first-person archery PvP shooter for up to 8 players. Pick a target, draw your bow, and aim carefully. No hitscan and no full-auto. Make every shot count.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5091370/extras/79b02d5ce654efc0395fdd4e675859dd.avif?t=1788200471\" width=630 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fifteen Game </strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">Breaking</span><strong> Changing Powerups</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go invisible with Phantom — just watch out for True Sight</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap up high with Cloud Hopper and rain arrows down on your foes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire three arrows at once with Multi-Nock, or go full artillery with Black Powder's explosive tips</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport across the map with Soul Shot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for special bows and arrows</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5091370/extras/aa86b32f0b85ed7110c2d41474750154.avif?t=1788200471\" width=630 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online PvP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to seven other friends. Host a private match or join a public lobby with &quot;Quick Join.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Friends?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add some bots to your lobby. They can run, jump, fight, and use powerups just like a real player. But be careful, some of them have gotten quite good at shooting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Customizable Game Settings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer skill over luck? Hosts can change powerup spawns to &quot;Never&quot; and run it as a pure, no-frills draw-and-shoot duel — no crutches, no gimmicks, just whoever's actually better with a bow. Or grab seven other friends and crank powerups to the max and see who can survive the longest. Enable teams to play a 4v4, a 2v2v2, or maybe a 1v5. It's up to you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Maps, Two Gamemodes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight it out across the Ruins, the Forest, and the Graveyard in Elimination or Deathmatch, with host-configurable win conditions — first to a kill count, last one standing after time runs out, or best of however many rounds you decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5091370/extras/159d59efa99c8bb3d666f8a33b3253ff.avif?t=1788200471\" width=1260 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>35 Achievements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do something cool in game and get a nice achievement on your profile. Try to collect them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play It Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full key rebinding for every action. Plenty of in-game options. Change your name and your character's color. Public or private lobbies with quick join. No accounts beyond Steam.</p>", "short_description": "Draw, aim, and duel up to 7 other players with bows, explosive arrows, and 15 powerups. Satisfying shots, fluid movement, and multiplayer chaos. Grab your friends and prove your archery superiority!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5091370/22ef374cfa67abb86dbbaf198e0196e80e0740c4/header.jpg?t=1788200471", "capsu